  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "When authentication fails",
      "items": [
        "Token and TLS are set up once in Configure (internal/provider/api/config.go), before any resource call",
        "cacert_file and insecure apply to Lakekeeper requests, not to the token request to auth_url",
        "Configure errors surface as 'Failed to create Lakekeeper Client from provider configuration'"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "When a request fails",
      "items": [
        "Every API client method wraps SDK errors in *api.Error with the HTTP status",
        "The resource reports it to Terraform as an error diagnostic",
        "lakekeeper_role is the example; other resources call other API client methods along the same path"
      ]
    }
  ]
